    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This collection contains replication material for Hwang et al. 2023. “Curating Training Data for Reliable Large-Scale Visual Data Analysis: Lessons from Identifying Trash in Street View Imagery\". Sociological Methods and Research. The input data for all tables and figures in the paper are stored here. Our analysis code is available at Github (https://github.com/Changing-Cities-Research-Lab/gsv-training-replication-repo).",
